WEBVTT

NOTE
English captions for a 52-second excerpt of Sintel (2010), Durian Open Movie Project, Blender Foundation, CC BY 3.0.
Subtitles from Wikimedia Commons (TimedText), CC BY-SA 4.0; times shifted to start at the excerpt.

1
00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:05.500
This blade has a dark past.

2
00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:10.800
It has shed much innocent blood.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:16.450
You're a fool for traveling alone,
so completely unprepared.

4
00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:19.800
You're lucky your blood's still flowing.

5
00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:21.300
Thank you.

6
00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:24.000
So...

7
00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:28.800
What brings you to
the land of the gatekeepers?

8
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.500
I'm searching for someone.

9
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:37.200
Someone very dear?
A kindred spirit?

10
00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:40.000
A dragon.

11
00:00:43.850 --> 00:00:46.750
A dangerous quest for a lone hunter.

12
00:00:47.950 --> 00:00:50.870
I've been alone for
as long as I can remember.
